OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks answers on local
OL,4,Agovernment changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire County Council has
OL,7,Ftaken the first step towards a
OL,8,Fpotential legal challenge over the
OL,9,Frestructuring of local government in
OL,10,Fthe county.
OL,12,FIn July, the government announced its
OL,13,Fpreferred options for local government
OL,14,Freorganisation (LGR), which will see
OL,15,Ftraditional two-tier county and
OL,16,Fdistrict councils nationwide replaced
OL,17,Fwith single unitary authorities.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
