OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks answers on local
OL,4,Agovernment changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK-controlled Nottinghamshire's
OL,7,Fleader Mick Barton wrote to the
OL,8,Fgovernment on Thursday over the
OL,9,F"reasoning, evidence and rationale"
OL,10,Fbehind the decision to create two
OL,11,Fcouncils.
OL,13,FThe pre-action letter seeks "more
OL,14,Fclarity" from government ahead of a
OL,15,Fpossible judicial review being launched
OL,16,Finto how LGR was drawn up in the
OL,17,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
